    "y": 245,
    "w": 601,
    "h": 72
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "This innovative system uses a V-shaped mesh design that allows the separation of abrasive solids while maximizing the open area to flow fluid. This operational advantage makes the Tubing Screen one of the best options against the abrasive effects of sand.",
